sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (browser)
    participant E as Editor (React Flow)
    participant S as Next.js server (tRPC)
    participant D as Postgres (Prisma)
    participant I as Inngest
    participant X as Provider (AI / HTTP / messaging)
    participant R as Realtime channel

    U->>E: Run workflow (manual trigger)
    E->>S: protectedProcedure workflows.execute
    S->>D: INSERT execution? (dispatched via Inngest)
    S->>I: sendWorkflowExecution event workflows/execute.workflow
    I->>D: step create-execution (status RUNNING)
    I->>D: prepare-workflow + find-user-id
    I->>I: topologicalSort(nodes, connections)
    loop each node in order
        I->>R: publish status loading
        R-->>E: node -> loading
        I->>X: executor performs work (AI / HTTP / messaging)
        X-->>I: result merged into context
        alt success
            I->>R: publish status success
            R-->>E: node -> success
        else error
            I->>R: publish status error
            R-->>E: node -> error
            I->>I: retries = 3 in prod, 0 in dev
        end
    end
    I->>D: update-execution SUCCESS, output = context
    alt function exhausted retries
        I->>D: onFailure -> Execution FAILED + errorStack
    end
    E->>S: useSuspenseQuery refresh executions
    S->>D: read execution history
    D-->>E: list with status + output
